msgid ""
"Would you like to respect or ignore embedded lang tags by default?\n"
"\n"
"Respecting them will use relevant typographic rules to render their content, "
"while ignoring them will always use the main language typography rules.\n"
"\n"
"The current default (★) is to respect them."
msgstr ""
"Vols aplicar o ignorar les etiquetes d'idioma incrustades per defecte?\n"
"\n"
"Si s'apliquen, s'utilitzaran les regles tipogràfiques pertinents per a "
"representar el contingut, mentre que si s'ignoren, s'utilitzaran les regles "
"tipogràfiques de l'idioma principal.\n"
"\n"
"El valor per defecte actual (★) és aplicar-les."

